Package: ShinyRegionalAggregate
Type: Package
Title: Producing Regional Aggregates for UNICEF Child Mortality Indicators
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yang", "Liu", email = "yanliu@unicef.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: A Shiny application that produces regional aggregates of child 
    mortality estimates based on individually selected countries. Uses the 
    UN IGME's latest estimates of neonatal, infant and under-five mortality 
    rates. The package allows deployment both as a standalone Shiny app and 
    as a package-based application.
